  m_Name: Level1(1-3)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "That\u2019s nice, but\u2026 do you plan to return? To the workshop, I mean?"
  - "Return?\r\nWell, of course, I\u2019ll go back! They\u2019ll send for me soon\u2014they
    must. The workshop can\u2019t function without me, after all."
  - "But\u2026 I suppose I haven\u2019t thought much about how. It\u2019s not like
    I can simply walk out of here, right?\r\nI\u2019m sure it will all work itself
    out. It always does."
  responses:
  - responseText: Find It Weird?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e32b38849a0c6ca419dfddaa0bd4a5e2, type: 2}
    moodValue: 1
  - responseText: Piece Unveiled?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c894d1b78535c5418afb82b62104c81, type: 2}
    moodValue: 3
